  "business-01": "<div class=\"phero\"><div class=\"wrap phero-grid\"><div><div class=\"crumb\"><a href=\"./\">Home</a> / For businesses</div><span class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"background:var(--rtint);color:var(--red)\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m11 17 2 2a1 1 0 1 0 3-3\"></path><path d=\"m14 14 2.5 2.5a1 1 0 1 0 3-3l-3.88-3.88a3 3 0 0 0-4.24 0l-.88.88a1 1 0 1 1-3-3l2.81-2.81a5.79 5.79 0 0 1 7.06-.87l.47.28a2 2 0 0 0 1.42.25L21 4\"></path><path d=\"m21 3 1 11h-2\"></path><path d=\"M3 3 2 14l6.5 6.5a1 1 0 1 0 3-3\"></path><path d=\"M3 4h8\"></path></svg> For businesses</span><h1 style=\"font-size:clamp(32px,4.4vw,54px);margin-top:14px\">Reach the last mile <span style=\"color:var(--blue)\">without building a field force</span></h1><p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">Service providers, fintechs, insurers and employers work with Online Saathi to reach underserved workers and hire local talent through a trained, assisted network.</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:26px\"><a class=\"btn btn-blue\" href=\"business.php#partner-form\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 10h18\"></path><path d=\"m9 16 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> Become a partner</a><a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"business.php#solutions\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.39 4.39a1 1 0 0 0 1.68-.474 2.5 2.5 0 1 1 3.014 3.015 1 1 0 0 0-.474 1.68l1.683 1.682a2.414 2.414 0 0 1 0 3.414L19.61 15.39a1 1 0 0 1-1.68-.474 2.5 2.5 0 1 0-3.014 3.015 1 1 0 0 1 .474 1.68l-1.683 1.682a2.414 2.414 0 0 1-3.414 0L8.61 19.61a1 1 0 0 0-1.68.474 2.5 2.5 0 1 1-3.014-3.015 1 1 0 0 0 .474-1.68l-1.683-1.682a2.414 2.414 0 0 1 0-3.414L4.39 8.61a1 1 0 0 1 1.68.474 2.5 2.5 0 1 0 3.014-3.015 1 1 0 0 1-.474-1.68l1.683-1.682a2.414 2.414 0 0 1 3.414 0z\"></path></svg> See solutions</a></div></div><div class=\"kpis\"><div class=\"kpi\"><b data-count=\"2000\" data-suf=\"+\">2000+</b><span>trained Saathis</span></div><div class=\"kpi\"><b data-count=\"10\" data-suf=\"+\">10+</b><span>service providers onboarded</span></div><div class=\"kpi\"><b>125k+</b><span>transactions processed</span></div><div class=\"kpi\"><b>₹150 Cr+</b><span>transaction value</span></div></div></div></div>",
  "business-02": "<div class=\"chapter\" id=\"how-we-help\"><div class=\"wrap\"><span class=\"cnum\">01</span><div><b>How we help</b><small>Your bridge to India’s informal workforce</small></div></div></div>",
  "business-03": "<section><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"center reveal\" style=\"margin-bottom:40px\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m11 17 2 2a1 1 0 1 0 3-3\"></path><path d=\"m14 14 2.5 2.5a1 1 0 1 0 3-3l-3.88-3.88a3 3 0 0 0-4.24 0l-.88.88a1 1 0 1 1-3-3l2.81-2.81a5.79 5.79 0 0 1 7.06-.87l.47.28a2 2 0 0 0 1.42.25L21 4\"></path><path d=\"m21 3 1 11h-2\"></path><path d=\"M3 3 2 14l6.5 6.5a1 1 0 1 0 3-3\"></path><path d=\"M3 4h8\"></path></svg> How we help</span><h2>Your bridge to India’s informal workforce</h2><p class=\"lead\">We build a strong worker community that connects people with jobs, services and growth — and connects businesses with the customers and talent they can’t reach on their own.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"grid g3\">\n    <div class=\"card hov reveal\"><div class=\"chip c-blue\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m2 7 4.41-4.41A2 2 0 0 1 7.83 2h8.34a2 2 0 0 1 1.42.59L22 7\"></path><path d=\"M4 12v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-8\"></path><path d=\"M15 22v-4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M2 7h20\"></path><path d=\"M22 7v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2a2.7 2.7 0 0 1-1.59-.63.7.7 0 0 0-.82 0A2.7 2.7 0 0 1 16 12a2.7 2.7 0 0 1-1.59-.63.7.7 0 0 0-.82 0A2.7 2.7 0 0 1 12 12a2.7 2.7 0 0 1-1.59-.63.7.7 0 0 0-.82 0A2.7 2.7 0 0 1 8 12a2.7 2.7 0 0 1-1.59-.63.7.7 0 0 0-.82 0A2.7 2.7 0 0 1 4 12a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V7\"></path></svg></div><h3>A ready distribution network</h3><p>2000+ trained Saathis at shops, kiosks and in communities — selling and servicing your product with human assistance.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card hov reveal\"><div class=\"chip c-green\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg></div><h3>A motivated local talent pool</h3><p>Employers reach verified, skill-matched workers through Safe Jobs Connect and our trusted employer network.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card hov reveal\"><div class=\"chip c-red\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><h3>Trust and compliance built in</h3><p>Assisted KYC, consent and receipts, with AML and KYC compliance on financial services.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card hov reveal\"><div class=\"chip c-amber\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m5 8 6 6\"></path><path d=\"m4 14 6-6 2-3\"></path><path d=\"M2 5h12\"></path><path d=\"M7 2h1\"></path><path d=\"m22 22-5-10-5 10\"></path><path d=\"M14 18h6\"></path></svg></div><h3>Local language, local trust</h3><p>Saathis explain your product in the customer’s own language — reducing drop-offs.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card hov reveal\"><div class=\"chip c-blue\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"20\" x=\"5\" y=\"2\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path></svg></div><h3>One technology platform</h3><p>Your service sits inside the Saathi app and dashboard alongside 50+ others.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card hov reveal\"><div class=\"chip c-green\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16\"></path><path d=\"m19 9-5 5-4-4-3 3\"></path></svg></div><h3>Visibility on performance</h3><p>Track activity, users, repeat usage and complaints.</p></div>\n  </div>\n</div></section>",
  "business-04": "<section class=\"sec-alt\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"center reveal\" style=\"margin-bottom:40px\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"8\" width=\"18\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M12 8v13\"></path><path d=\"M19 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-7\"></path><path d=\"M7.5 8a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5A4.8 8 0 0 1 12 8a4.8 8 0 0 1 4.5-5 2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5\"></path></svg> Partner benefits</span><h2>Why partner with Online Saathi?</h2></div>\n  <div class=\"hl-grid\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px\">\n    <div class=\"hl-card s-blue reveal\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i bgi\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg><div class=\"n\" data-count=\"90000\" data-suf=\"+\">90,000+</div><p>workers already reached through the network</p></div>\n    <div class=\"hl-card s-green reveal\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i bgi\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M18 8c0 3.613-3.869 7.429-5.393 8.795a1 1 0 0 1-1.214 0C9.87 15.429 6 11.613 6 8a6 6 0 0 1 12 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M8.714 14h-3.71a1 1 0 0 0-.948.683l-2.004 6A1 1 0 0 0 3 22h18a1 1 0 0 0 .948-1.316l-2-6a1 1 0 0 0-.949-.684h-3.712\"></path></svg><div class=\"n\" data-count=\"2000\" data-suf=\"+\">2000+</div><p>trained Saathis ready to distribute your service</p></div>\n    <div class=\"hl-card s-red reveal\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i bgi\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m17 2 4 4-4 4\"></path><path d=\"M3 11v-1a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h14\"></path><path d=\"m7 22-4-4 4-4\"></path><path d=\"M21 13v1a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H3\"></path></svg><div class=\"n\">125k+</div><p>transactions processed — proven operational rails</p></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid g3\">\n    <div class=\"card hov reveal\"><div class=\"chip c-blue\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><h3>Access underserved customers</h3><p>Informal and migrant workers that digital-only channels routinely miss.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card hov reveal\"><div class=\"chip c-green\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><polyline points=\"22 17 13.5 8.5 8.5 13.5 2 7\"></polyline><polyline points=\"16 17 22 17 22 11\"></polyline></svg></div><h3>Lower acquisition cost</h3><p>Local trust and in-language assistance reduce drop-offs and cost-to-serve.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card hov reveal\"><div class=\"chip c-red\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg></div><h3>A trained field force — on demand</h3><p>Deploy across districts without hiring or managing your own agents.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card hov reveal\"><div class=\"chip c-amber\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16\"></path><path d=\"M18 17V9\"></path><path d=\"M13 17V5\"></path><path d=\"M8 17v-3\"></path></svg></div><h3>Transparent reporting</h3><p>Track transactions, users, outcomes and complaints.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card hov reveal\"><div class=\"chip c-blue\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><h3>Assisted, compliant journeys</h3><p>Consent, KYC support and receipts on every assisted transaction.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card hov reveal\"><div class=\"chip c-green\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"></path></svg></div><h3>Measurable social impact</h3><p>Every transaction creates value for workers and income for Saathis.</p></div>\n  </div>\n</div></section>",
  "business-05": "<section><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"center reveal\" style=\"margin-bottom:44px\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"13\" y=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg> How distribution works</span><h2>Your service, at the last mile</h2></div>\n  <div class=\"flow reveal\">\n    <div class=\"fs\"><div class=\"chip c-blue\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M6 22V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v18Z\"></path><path d=\"M6 12H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2\"></path><path d=\"M18 9h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2\"></path><path d=\"M10 6h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 10h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 14h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 18h4\"></path></svg></div><b>Your service</b><p>Product, scheme or job</p></div>\n    <div class=\"fs\"><div class=\"chip c-green\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M12 22v-5\"></path><path d=\"M9 8V2\"></path><path d=\"M15 8V2\"></path><path d=\"M18 8v5a4 4 0 0 1-4 4h-4a4 4 0 0 1-4-4V8Z\"></path></svg></div><b>Integrate</b><p>Onto the Saathi app</p></div>\n    <div class=\"fs\"><div class=\"chip c-red\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z\"></path><path d=\"M22 10v6\"></path><path d=\"M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5\"></path></svg></div><b>Train Saathis</b><p>Product & compliance</p></div>\n    <div class=\"fs\"><div class=\"chip c-amber\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg></div><b>Reach workers</b><p>Assisted, in-language</p></div>\n    <div class=\"fs\"><div class=\"chip c-blue\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16\"></path><path d=\"m19 9-5 5-4-4-3 3\"></path></svg></div><b>Report</b><p>Activity & outcomes</p></div>\n  </div>\n</div></section>",
  "business-06": "<div class=\"chapter\" id=\"solutions\"><div class=\"wrap\"><span class=\"cnum\">02</span><div><b>Solutions</b><small>Ways to work with us</small></div></div></div>",
  "business-07": "<section class=\"sec-alt\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"center reveal\" style=\"margin-bottom:40px\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.39 4.39a1 1 0 0 0 1.68-.474 2.5 2.5 0 1 1 3.014 3.015 1 1 0 0 0-.474 1.68l1.683 1.682a2.414 2.414 0 0 1 0 3.414L19.61 15.39a1 1 0 0 1-1.68-.474 2.5 2.5 0 1 0-3.014 3.015 1 1 0 0 1 .474 1.68l-1.683 1.682a2.414 2.414 0 0 1-3.414 0L8.61 19.61a1 1 0 0 0-1.68.474 2.5 2.5 0 1 1-3.014-3.015 1 1 0 0 0 .474-1.68l-1.683-1.682a2.414 2.414 0 0 1 0-3.414L4.39 8.61a1 1 0 0 1 1.68.474 2.5 2.5 0 1 0 3.014-3.015 1 1 0 0 1-.474-1.68l1.683-1.682a2.414 2.414 0 0 1 3.414 0z\"></path></svg> Solutions</span><h2>Ways to work with us</h2></div>\n  <div class=\"grid g3\">\n    <div class=\"card hov reveal\"><div class=\"chip c-blue\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"12\" x=\"2\" y=\"6\" rx=\"2\"></rect><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M6 12h.01M18 12h.01\"></path></svg></div><h3>Financial services distribution</h3><p>Distribute remittance, AEPS, bill payments, insurance and other financial products through Saathi counters.</p><ul class=\"ticks\"><li><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> Assisted KYC and onboarding</li><li><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> Repeat, cash-preferring customers</li></ul></div>\n    <div class=\"card hov reveal\"><div class=\"chip c-green\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M16 20V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16\"></path><rect width=\"20\" height=\"14\" x=\"2\" y=\"6\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></div><h3>Hiring through Safe Jobs Connect</h3><p>Reach a motivated local talent pool with skill-based matching and Saathi-assisted applications.</p><ul class=\"ticks\"><li><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> Verified worker profiles</li><li><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> Fair, middleman-free hiring</li></ul></div>\n    <div class=\"card hov reveal\"><div class=\"chip c-red\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M12 22v-5\"></path><path d=\"M9 8V2\"></path><path d=\"M15 8V2\"></path><path d=\"M18 8v5a4 4 0 0 1-4 4h-4a4 4 0 0 1-4-4V8Z\"></path></svg></div><h3>Platform & API integration</h3><p>Plug your service into the Saathi app and dashboard to go live across the network.</p><ul class=\"ticks\"><li><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> One integration, many Saathis</li><li><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> Activity and outcome reporting</li></ul></div>\n    <div class=\"card hov reveal\"><div class=\"chip c-amber\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m3 11 18-5v12L3 14v-3z\"></path><path d=\"M11.6 16.8a3 3 0 1 1-5.8-1.6\"></path></svg></div><h3>Awareness & outreach</h3><p>Run on-ground campaigns and community meetings with trained local Saathis.</p><ul class=\"ticks\"><li><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> In-language explanations</li><li><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> Reach worker communities directly</li></ul></div>\n    <div class=\"card hov reveal\"><div class=\"chip c-blue\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M18 8c0 3.613-3.869 7.429-5.393 8.795a1 1 0 0 1-1.214 0C9.87 15.429 6 11.613 6 8a6 6 0 0 1 12 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M8.714 14h-3.71a1 1 0 0 0-.948.683l-2.004 6A1 1 0 0 0 3 22h18a1 1 0 0 0 .948-1.316l-2-6a1 1 0 0 0-.949-.684h-3.712\"></path></svg></div><h3>District & State Partners</h3><p>Build and grow the Saathi network in your district or state as an Online Saathi partner.</p><ul class=\"ticks\"><li><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> Recruit and support local Saathis</li><li><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> Grow services in your region</li></ul></div>\n    <div class=\"card hov reveal\"><div class=\"chip c-green\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z\"></path><path d=\"M22 10v6\"></path><path d=\"M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5\"></path></svg></div><h3>Training centres</h3><p>Connect your trainees to job opportunities and help train new Saathis.</p><ul class=\"ticks\"><li><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> Placement linkages</li><li><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> Skilling partnerships</li></ul></div>\n  </div>\n</div></section>",
  "business-08": "<section><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"center reveal\" style=\"margin-bottom:40px\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg> Use cases</span><h2>How partners work with us</h2></div>\n  <div class=\"uc\">\n    <div class=\"ucard reveal\"><div class=\"uh s-blue\"><div class=\"av\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"12\" x=\"2\" y=\"6\" rx=\"2\"></rect><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M6 12h.01M18 12h.01\"></path></svg></div><div><h3>Remittance & fintech providers</h3><small>Distribution partner</small></div></div><div class=\"ub\">\n      <div class=\"st\"><i class=\"c-red\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"8\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg></i><div><b>Challenge</b><p>Migrant customers prefer cash and trusted, local help.</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"st\"><i class=\"c-blue\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><polyline points=\"16 11 18 13 22 9\"></polyline></svg></i><div><b>With Online Saathi</b><p>Saathis offer the service at their counters with assisted KYC and receipts.</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"st\"><i class=\"c-green\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></i><div><b>Result</b><p>New customers and repeat transactions — as with our Indo-Nepal remittance partners.</p></div></div></div></div>\n    <div class=\"ucard reveal\"><div class=\"uh s-green\"><div class=\"av\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"M9 12h6\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v6\"></path></svg></div><div><h3>Insurers</h3><small>Micro-insurance distribution</small></div></div><div class=\"ub\">\n      <div class=\"st\"><i class=\"c-red\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"8\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg></i><div><b>Challenge</b><p>Low awareness and high cost to enrol informal workers.</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"st\"><i class=\"c-blue\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><polyline points=\"16 11 18 13 22 9\"></polyline></svg></i><div><b>With Online Saathi</b><p>Trained Bima Mitra Saathis explain products and enrol families.</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"st\"><i class=\"c-green\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></i><div><b>Result</b><p>Wider coverage among first-time insurance customers.</p></div></div></div></div>\n    <div class=\"ucard reveal\"><div class=\"uh s-red\"><div class=\"av\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M2 20a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8l-7 5V8l-7 5V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2Z\"></path><path d=\"M17 18h1\"></path><path d=\"M12 18h1\"></path><path d=\"M7 18h1\"></path></svg></div><div><h3>Employers</h3><small>Hiring verified workers</small></div></div><div class=\"ub\">\n      <div class=\"st\"><i class=\"c-red\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"8\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg></i><div><b>Challenge</b><p>Unreliable hiring through middlemen and high attrition.</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"st\"><i class=\"c-blue\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><polyline points=\"16 11 18 13 22 9\"></polyline></svg></i><div><b>With Online Saathi</b><p>Safe Jobs Connect refers registered workers through Rojgar Mitra Saathis.</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"st\"><i class=\"c-green\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></i><div><b>Result</b><p>Verified candidates and fair, transparent recruitment.</p></div></div></div></div>\n    <div class=\"ucard reveal\"><div class=\"uh s-navy\"><div class=\"av\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"20\" x=\"5\" y=\"2\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path></svg></div><div><h3>Digital platforms & apps</h3><small>Assisted onboarding</small></div></div><div class=\"ub\">\n      <div class=\"st\"><i class=\"c-red\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"8\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg></i><div><b>Challenge</b><p>First-time digital users drop off during sign-up and KYC.</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"st\"><i class=\"c-blue\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><polyline points=\"16 11 18 13 22 9\"></polyline></svg></i><div><b>With Online Saathi</b><p>Saathis guide users through onboarding in their language.</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"st\"><i class=\"c-green\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></i><div><b>Result</b><p>Higher completion and more active users from underserved segments.</p></div></div></div></div>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"illus\">Illustrative partnership models.</p>\n</div></section>",
  "business-09": "<section class=\"sec-alt\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"center reveal\" style=\"margin-bottom:40px\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"19\" r=\"3\"></circle><path d=\"M9 19h8.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0-7h-11a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-7H15\"></path><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"5\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg> Getting started</span><h2>From first call to go-live</h2></div>\n  <div class=\"steps\">\n    <div class=\"step reveal\"><div class=\"num\">1</div><h3>Discuss</h3><p>Share your goals, product and target customers.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"step reveal\"><div class=\"num\" style=\"background:var(--green)\">2</div><h3>Design</h3><p>Agree the model, geography and commercial terms.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"step reveal\"><div class=\"num\" style=\"background:var(--red)\">3</div><h3>Integrate & train</h3><p>Go live on the app and train Saathis.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"step reveal\"><div class=\"num\" style=\"background:var(--navy)\">4</div><h3>Launch & grow</h3><p>Track performance and scale what works.</p></div>\n  </div>\n</div></section>",
  "business-10": "<section id=\"partner-form\"><div class=\"wrap split\" style=\"align-items:start\">\n  <div class=\"reveal\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 10h18\"></path><path d=\"m9 16 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> Let’s talk</span><h2>Start a partnership</h2><p class=\"lead\">Tell us what you’d like to achieve. Our partnerships team will get back to you.</p>\n    <ul class=\"ticks\"><li><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> Service providers & fintechs</li><li><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> Employers</li><li><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> District & state partners</li><li><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> Incubators & ecosystem partners</li></ul></div>\n  <form class=\"formcard reveal\" data-form=\"Partnership enquiry\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin-bottom:18px\">Partnership enquiry</h3>\n    <div class=\"row2\"><div class=\"field\"><label>Name</label><input name=\"Name\" required></div><div class=\"field\"><label>Organisation</label><input name=\"Organisation\" required></div></div>\n    <div class=\"row2\"><div class=\"field\"><label>Work email</label><input name=\"Email\" type=\"email\" required></div><div class=\"field\"><label>Phone</label><input name=\"Phone\" type=\"tel\"></div></div>\n    <div class=\"field\"><label>Partner type</label><select name=\"Partner type\"><option>Service provider / fintech</option><option>Insurer</option><option>Employer</option><option>District / State Partner</option><option>Training centre</option><option>Incubator / ecosystem</option></select></div>\n    <div class=\"field\"><label>Message</label><textarea name=\"Message\"></textarea></div>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-blue\" type=\"submit\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.5-19a.496.496 0 0 0-.635-.635l-19 6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.024.937l7.93 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 1.112 1.11z\"></path><path d=\"m21.854 2.147-10.94 10.939\"></path></svg> Send enquiry</button><div class=\"ok\">Thank you! WhatsApp has opened with your enquiry — just press send.</div>\n  </form>\n</div></section>",
  "business-11": "<div class=\"chapter\" id=\"partners\"><div class=\"wrap\"><span class=\"cnum\">03</span><div><b>Partners & incubators</b><small>The organisations behind our growth</small></div></div></div>",
  "business-12": "<section class=\"sec-alt\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"reveal\" style=\"margin-bottom:28px\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg> Service partners</span><h2>Our service partners</h2></div>\n  <div class=\"logowall\"><div class=\"logocard reveal\"><span class=\"lm\">PM</span><span class=\"tag\">Remittance partner</span><h3>Prabhu Money Transfer</h3><p>Indo-Nepal money transfer through Saathi counters.</p></div><div class=\"logocard reveal\"><span class=\"lm\">IME</span><span class=\"tag\">Remittance partner</span><h3>IME</h3><p>IME Remit transfers from India to any bank in Nepal.</p></div><div class=\"logocard reveal\"><span class=\"lm\">eKO<img src=\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=eko.in&sz=128\" alt=\"eKO logo\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.remove()\"></span><span class=\"tag\">Fintech partner</span><h3>eKO</h3><p>Banking and payment rails for assisted services.</p></div><div class=\"logocard reveal\" style=\"border-style:dashed;justify-content:center;align-items:flex-start\"><div class=\"chip c-blue\" style=\"margin:0\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg></div><h3>Your organisation</h3><p>Join 10+ providers already distributing through Saathis.</p><a class=\"link\" href=\"business.php#partner-form\">Partner with us <svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div>\n</div></section>",
  "business-13": "<section><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"reveal\" style=\"margin-bottom:28px\"><span class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"background:var(--gtint);color:var(--green)\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09z\"></path><path d=\"m12 15-3-3a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.35 22.35 0 0 1-4 2z\"></path><path d=\"M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 0 5 0\"></path><path d=\"M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5\"></path></svg> Incubators & ecosystem</span><h2>Incubated and supported by</h2><p class=\"lead\">Grants, incubation and ecosystem support from India’s leading social-innovation and startup institutions.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"logowall\"><div class=\"logocard reveal\"><span class=\"lm\">T<img src=\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=t-hub.co&sz=128\" alt=\"T-Hub logo\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.remove()\"></span><span class=\"tag\">Incubator</span><h3>T-Hub</h3><p>Hyderabad’s innovation hub — incubation and grant support.</p></div><div class=\"logocard reveal\"><span class=\"lm\">SA<img src=\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=socialalpha.org&sz=128\" alt=\"Social Alpha logo\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.remove()\"></span><span class=\"tag\">Incubator</span><h3>Social Alpha</h3><p>Social-innovation incubation and grant support.</p></div><div class=\"logocard reveal\"><span class=\"lm\">iH<img src=\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=ihubgujarat.in&sz=128\" alt=\"i-Hub Gujarat logo\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.remove()\"></span><span class=\"tag\">Incubator</span><h3>i-Hub Gujarat</h3><p>Gujarat’s startup hub — incubation and grant support.</p></div><div class=\"logocard reveal\"><span class=\"lm\">AIC<img src=\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=aic-rmp.org&sz=128\" alt=\"AIC RMP logo\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.remove()\"></span><span class=\"tag\">Incubator</span><h3>AIC RMP</h3><p>Atal Incubation Centre – Rambhau Mhalgi Prabodhini.</p></div><div class=\"logocard reveal\"><span class=\"lm\">EDI<img src=\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=ediindia.org&sz=128\" alt=\"EDI & TIF logo\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.remove()\"></span><span class=\"tag\">Ecosystem</span><h3>EDI & TIF</h3><p>Entrepreneurship Development Institute of India.</p></div><div class=\"logocard reveal\"><span class=\"lm\">NS<img src=\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=nsdcindia.org&sz=128\" alt=\"NSDC logo\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.remove()\"></span><span class=\"tag\">Skilling ecosystem</span><h3>NSDC</h3><p>National Skill Development Corporation ecosystem.</p></div><div class=\"logocard reveal\"><span class=\"lm\">GL<img src=\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=glpc.gipl.in&sz=128\" alt=\"GLPC logo\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.remove()\"></span><span class=\"tag\">Government</span><h3>GLPC</h3><p>Gujarat Livelihood Promotion Company.</p></div><div class=\"logocard reveal\"><span class=\"lm\">GJ<img src=\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=gujaratindia.gov.in&sz=128\" alt=\"Government of Gujarat logo\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.remove()\"></span><span class=\"tag\">Government</span><h3>Government of Gujarat</h3><p>State ecosystem support for social enterprise.</p></div></div>\n</div></section>"
